      "message": "I think its a minimum allocation alignment of 4?  the ubsan ran --copt\u003d-fsanitize\u003dalignment \nin the external bug report/fix they only changed the call to this funcion.\npreviously i cast to int64 as an optimization to read 8 bytes, which is larger than ARGB.\n\nThis function is now the same as linear, doing a __riscv_vlseg2e32_v_u32m4\n\nI dont have a good way to benchmark on real hardware at the moment, so I rely on AI for performance estimates.",
